#: conf.json:summary
msgid "A MoonBit library for parallel execution through native and JavaScript FFI runtimes, defined by a normative specification."
msgstr "一个通过原生与 JavaScript FFI 运行时实现并行执行的 MoonBit 库，由一份规范性规格定义。"

