#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "luna_thread"
msgstr "luna_thread"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "luna_thread is a MoonBit library workspace for parallel execution through the foreign function interface. MoonBit code builds a workflow graph, and a native runtime executes it; a JavaScript compatibility path reaches the same runtime through an N-API addon."
msgstr "luna_thread 是一个通过外部函数接口（FFI）进行并行执行的 MoonBit 库工作区。MoonBit 代码构造 workflow 图，由原生运行时执行；JavaScript 兼容路径则通过 N-API 插件访问同一个运行时。"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "Realization paths"
msgstr "实现路径"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "MoonBit facade → MoonBit C FFI → C wrapper → C runtime"
msgstr "MoonBit facade → MoonBit C FFI → C 包装层 → C 运行时"

#: manual/index.md:8
msgid "MoonBit facade → MoonBit JS FFI → JS wrapper → N-API addon → C runtime"
msgstr "MoonBit facade → MoonBit JS FFI → JS 包装层 → N-API 插件 → C 运行时"

#: manual/index.md:10
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/index.md:12
msgid "**`facade`** (`luna_thread/`): the root MoonBit package that applications import. See the [API reference](api/facade.md), the [design notes](design/facade.md) and the [tutorial](tutorial/facade.md)."
msgstr "**`facade`**（`luna_thread/`）：应用程序导入的 MoonBit 根包。参见 [API 参考](api/facade.md)、[设计说明](design/facade.md)和[教程](tutorial/facade.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:13
msgid "**`backend`** (`native/`, `js/` and `luna_thread/backend/`): the native C runtime and the Node.js addon that realize the FFI design. See the [API reference](api/backend.md), the [design notes](design/backend.md) and the [tutorial](tutorial/backend.md)."
msgstr "**`backend`**（`native/`、`js/` 与 `luna_thread/backend/`）：实现 FFI 设计的原生 C 运行时和 Node.js 插件。参见 [API 参考](api/backend.md)、[设计说明](design/backend.md)和[教程](tutorial/backend.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:15
msgid "Specification"
msgstr "规格"

#: manual/index.md:17
msgid "The specification is the authoritative design narrative for the workspace: it defines the workflow graph, capabilities, ownership transfer and separation-safe execution that the facade and the backends must realize. The English text is normative; the Chinese text is a strict mirror of it."
msgstr "该规格是本工作区的权威设计叙述：它定义了 facade 与各后端必须实现的 workflow 图、capability、所有权转移和分离安全执行。英文文本具有规范效力，中文文本是其严格镜像。"

#: manual/index.md:19
msgid "[A Normative Specification for a MoonBit Workflow and Parallel FFI Runtime](../attachments/moonbit_parallel_spec/main.typ)"
msgstr "[MoonBit Workflow 与并行 FFI Runtime 的规范性规格](../attachments/moonbit_parallel_spec/main.typ)"

